{"type":"reasoning","timestamp":1790680015646,"sessionID":"ses_f132db44effejOC7YW0uFAg7SL","part":{"id":"prt_0ecd89dbd001Y8O6alT6d6ojb7","messageID":"msg_0ecd8978d001bv214ZzlNwZWNz","sessionID":"ses_f132db44effejOC7YW0uFAg7SL","type":"reasoning","text":"My monkeypatch of `ag.step` causes recursion because `orig_step` internally calls `self.step(...)` recursively (in `update`). I need to avoid the wrapper. Let me instead hook `update_state` or just record from the env's step in DirectEnv.\n\nSimplest: trace in DirectEnv.step after env.step, reading agent's blstats via a reference.\n\nLet me restructure: DirectEnv holds a reference to the agent and records there.","time":{"start":1790680014269,"end":1790680015642}}}
