reproduction, means.\n- Discovered XP-driven.\n- Built diagnostic runner. Mention direct NLE action mapping pitfall (`_ACTIONS.index(action)`), big stack needed due recursion.\n- Seed 0 metrics and early seeds.\n- Starting inventory and spell probe.\n- Existing machinery.\n\nActive:\n- no production changes.\n- design plan for spell use, with components and details. Include safety conditions and priorities perhaps.\n- Background diagnostics for seeds 1,2,4... running/possibly done.\n\nBlocked none.\n\nNext moves:\n1 inspect background JSON and implement.\n2 test smoke/import and paired eval 15 seeds.\n\nRelevant files list.\n\nNeed be careful: \"one focused change\" - proposed implementation is arguably learn + cast = one idea. Might mention this as active. Prior question whether zap wand. The agent was leaning implementing learn+cast. Need not include zapping perhaps.\n\nNeed mention current working directory repo has no git? not known. Don't assert.\n\nNeed mention exact existing symbols:\n- `Character.parse_spellcast_view()` in character.py has `if self.agent.blstats.score > 0 ... self.role != HEALER: return`? Need read exact. Conversation read offsets 490 etc but actual code not shown. Earlier rg said `character.py:194: \"attack...` truncated. The assistant stated guard `role not in (HEALER,)`; should be accurate enough.\n- `Agent.cast` in agent.py already.\n- `Agent._fight2_perform_action` needs branch.\n- `fight_heur.get_available_actions` and `ranged_priority` ray geometry; priorities melee 1/16, ranged 11, cast proposed 20.\n- `global_logic.global_strategy` preempt list.\n- `Item.category == nh.SPBOOK_CLASS`; items names maybe object has name. Need verify.\n- reading via `A.Command.READ`, letter via `inventory.items.get_letter(item)`, Continue prompt, blind.\n- `wait_out_unexpected_state` handles blind.\n- parse cost level and fail chance perhaps.\n\nMaybe mention `Character.known_spells` isn't initialized/parse not called in main; active plan. StatsLogger h