{"type":"text","timestamp":1790680864247,"sessionID":"ses_f132db44effejOC7YW0uFAg7SL","part":{"id":"prt_0ece5653f0018eEyrW5O4ixzeu","messageID":"msg_0ece52486001z0FGwwaRu2VZEA","sessionID":"ses_f132db44effejOC7YW0uFAg7SL","type":"text","text":"## Objective\n- Make one focused change in `/workspace/autoascend/` that improves `wiz-hum-cha-mal` progression, with a `# hypothesis:` comment.\n- Preserve the bot contract, avoid seed-specific tuning, and judge the change by paired per-seed results rather than the coarse mean.\n\n## Important Details\n- Baseline: **0.0624** mean over seeds 0–14; champion **0.1907**; bot never ascends.\n- Prior HP-floor experiment is **rejected**: 0.0650 mean, but only 2 seeds forward and 5 backward. Do not repeat.\n- Progression uses BALROG-style max of depth and XP achievements; every published result matches an `Xp:N` value, not its deepest level.\n- Current first milestone is `BE_ON_FIRST_LEVEL`: farm dlvl 1 until XL 8. Thus raising survival and XP rate is more directly valuable here than descending early.\n- Acceptance requires improvement on most seeds; one seed can swing progress by ~0.18.\n- Required contract:\n  - Edit `autoascend/`, not `arena_adapter.py`.\n  - `make_agent()` must retain `reset(observation)` and `act(observation) -> int`.\n  - Exceptions, invalid actions, or timeouts zero an episode.\n  - Include an exact `# hypothesis: ...` comment.\n- Local arena reproduces the published baseline exactly:\n  - `python -m nethackers.arena.run --solution /workspace --batch '[[0,\"wiz-hum-cha-mal\"],...]' --evaluation-id local --secret public --max-parallel-evals 8 --out /home/agent/nhwork/baseline.json`\n  - Host has 1 CPU; full 15-seed run takes about 4 minutes.\n- Important runtime pitfall for direct NLE drivers: convert action objects to indices with `_ACTIONS.index(action)` and run with a large recursion limit/thread stack.\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- Inspected `autoascend/agent.py`, `autoascend/global_logic.py`, `autoascend/combat/fight_heur.py`, `autoascend/character.py`, inventory/item code, and arena scoring.\n- Confirmed `/opt/kit/nethackers/arena/progress.py` computes progress from the highest depth or XP achievement.\n- Confirmed baseline results exactly:\n  - seed 0: 13697 turns, depth 1, 0.0369\n  - seed 3: 3052 turns, depth 1, 0.0208\n  - seed 13: 5206 turns, depth 1, 0.0242\n  - all 15 published values reproduced with mean 0.0624.\n- Built an in-process diagnostic runner at `/home/agent/nhwork/diag.py`; it records XP/HP/hunger snapshots, kills, messages, actions, and panics.\n- Seed 0 diagnostics:\n  - 190 kills in 13697 turns, only XL 6, and **122 panics**.\n  - Approximately 72 turns per kill.\n  - No spell casts despite having magic available.\n  - Near death it was polymorphed, losing XP and max HP.\n- Early-death diagnostics:\n  - seed 3: 37 kills, died to a grid bug at turn 3052.\n  - seed 10: 45 kills, died to a hobbit at turn 4014.\n  - seed 13: 44 kills, 101 panics, starvation; its pet repeatedly consumed corpses.\n- Verified the wizard starts with:\n  - blessed +1 quarterstaff\n  - wand of magic missile with 8 charges\n  - blessed spellbook of force bolt at inventory letter `l`\n  - spellbook of haste self at letter `m`\n  - cloak of magic resistance, +1 gain constitution ring, scrolls, potions, blindfold.\n- Verified the bot currently:\n  - never reads a spellbook;\n  - never casts a spell;\n  - never zaps the magic-missile wand;\n  - throws daggers and fights with the quarterstaff.\n- Verified spell machinery is feasible:\n  - Reading blessed force bolt produces `You begin to memorize the runes.`\n  - Difficult books prompt `This spellbook is difficult to comprehend.  Continue? [yn] (n)`.\n  - Reading can temporarily blind the character.\n  - The cast popup is:\n    - `Choose which spell to cast`\n    - `Name                 Level Category     Fail Retention`\n    - `a - force bolt             1   attack         0%  91%-100%`\n    - `b - haste self             3   escape        91%  76%-100%`\n  - This matches the existing regex in `Character.parse_spellcast_view()`.\n  - `Agent.cast(spell_name, direction)` already exists.\n\n### Active\n- No production files under `/workspace/autoascend/` have been changed yet.\n- Planned focused idea: **make the Wizard use magic instead of relying on weak melee**.\n- Likely implementation:\n  1. Initialize/parse known spells for any spellcasting role, removing the existing Healer-only restriction in `Character.parse_spellcast_view()`.\n  2. Add a safe `read_spellbook(item)` primitive using `A.Command.READ` and `inventory.items.get_letter(item)`, handling the `Continue?` prompt and avoiding reads next to hostile monsters.\n  3. Add a strategy that reads an unread spellbook from inventory or ground; avoid repeatedly reading the same book.\n  4. Add a `cast` combat action in `fight_heur.get_available_actions()` when a known attack spell has acceptable failure/energy requirements and a monster is in a clear ray.\n  5. Execute the action in `Agent._fight2_perform_action()` through the existing `Agent.cast()`.\n  6. Register the learning strategy in `GlobalLogic.global_strategy()` before combat.\n- Proposed cast priority is above ranged priority 11 and melee priority 16, approximately 20.\n- Background diagnostics were started for seeds `1 2 4 5 6 7 8 9 11 12 14`; completion marker is `/home/agent/nhwork/diag_done`.\n\n### Blocked\n- (none)\n\n## Next Move\n1. Check `/home/agent/nhwork/diag_done` and remaining seed JSON files, then implement the spell-learning/casting change in `character.py`, `agent.py`, `fight_heur.py`, and `global_logic.py` with one `# hypothesis:` comment.\n2. Run import/smoke checks, evaluate representative early seeds, then run all 15 paired seeds and retain only if most seeds move forward.\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `/workspace/autoascend/character.py`: spell names, `parse_spellcast_view()`, role restrictions, parsed failure/retention data.\n- `/workspace/autoascend/agent.py`: `cast()`, `atom_operation()`, `_fight2_perform_action()`, agent initialization, and main strategy loop.\n- `/workspace/autoascend/combat/fight_heur.py`: `get_available_actions()` and `ranged_priority()` ray geometry to mirror for spell targeting.\n- `/workspace/autoascend/combat/utils.py`: `line_dis_from()`, `inside()`, and action formatting.\n- `/workspace/autoascend/global_logic.py`: `global_strategy()` preempt ordering.\n- `/workspace/autoascend/item/inventory.py`: inventory letters and item-action primitives.\n- `/workspace/autoascend/item/item.py`: item category helpers; spellbooks use `nh.SPBOOK_CLASS`.\n- `/workspace/autoascend/item/inventory_items.py`: `get_letter(item)`.\n- `/workspace/autoascend/stats_logger.py`: already defines `cast_<spell>` counters.\n- `/home/agent/nhwork/diag.py`: diagnostic in-process runner.\n- `/home/agent/nhwork/probe2.py`: successful spellbook/cast-popup probe.\n- `/home/agent/nhwork/seed*.json`: collected diagnostic traces.\n- `/opt/kit/nethackers/arena/progress.py`: authoritative depth/XP progression values.\n- `/opt/kit/nethackers/arena/environment.py`: NLE environment and metric recording.\n- `/workspace/arena_adapter.py`: read-only contract glue; must not be modified.","time":{"start":1790680851775,"end":1790680864219}}}
