{"type":"reasoning","timestamp":1790681772798,"sessionID":"ses_f132db44effejOC7YW0uFAg7SL","part":{"id":"prt_0ecf363dc001Awqu9NKOWfToCH","messageID":"msg_0ecf35da0001ydaDd4GGTcnkSM","sessionID":"ses_f132db44effejOC7YW0uFAg7SL","type":"reasoning","text":"The `events/actions/msg_hist` I saw earlier came from stdout of the diag script (the JSON it printed), while the saved file has a different structure. Fine.\n\nLet me take a different approach: get hunger from the snapshots. Let me check the snapshot fields.\n\nActually, the important actionable insight is clear:\n\n**Hypothesis for the regressions**: force bolt costs 5 energy. The wizard's energy pool is tiny (6 at XP1, 20 at XP2). Casting drains it, and regaining it takes many turns of rest. Those turns are not spent eating. Result: starvation → fainting → death. Also, the `can_cast` gate (energy > 3) is wrong (real cost 5) so it repeatedly attempts impossible casts.\n\nTwo fixes:\n1. Correct the energy cost model (5 for level 1).\n2. Only cast at range >= 2 (preserve melee), so the spell is a genuine ranged tool and doesn't compete with the staff in melee.\n\nLet me look at the snapshots to confirm hunger was the binding constraint. Let me print a hunger time series from snapshots for candidate seed 0 vs baseline seed 0.\n\nLet me check the snapshot keys.","time":{"start":1790681768924,"end":1790681772793}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790681773853,"sessionID":"ses_f132db44effejOC7YW0uFAg7SL","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_function_l85i7dbnqos2_1","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /home/agent/nhwork && python - <<'EOF'\nimport json\nd=json.load(open('c0.json'))\nprint('snapshot keys:', list(d['snapshots'][0]))\nb=json.load(open('seed0.json'))\ndef series(d):\n    out=[]\n    for s in d['snapshots']:\n        out.append((s.get('turn'), s.get('xp'), s.get('hunger'), s.get('energy'), s.get('hp')))\n    return out\nprint('cand:', series(d)[:6])\nprint('base:', series(b)[:6])\nEOF"},"output":"snapshot keys: ['turn', 'xp', 'depth', 'hp', 'maxhp', 'hunger_state', 'energy', 'ac', 'gold', 'exp_pts', 'depth_num', 'lvl_num', 'inv']\ncand: [(1, 1, None, 6, 12), (401, 1, None, 6, 12), (805, 1, None, 6, 12), (1205, 2, None, 13, 22), (1605, 2, None, 3, 22), (2007, 3, None, 9, 28)]\nbase: [(1, 1, None, 6, 12), (403, 2, None, 20, 18), (805, 2, None, 20, 18), (1205, 2, None, 20, 16), (1605, 3, None, 26, 25), (2005, 3, None, 26, 25)]\n","metadata":{"output":"snapshot keys: ['turn', 'xp', 'depth', 'hp', 'maxhp', 'hunger_state', 'energy', 'ac', 'gold', 'exp_pts', 'depth_num', 'lvl_num', 'inv']\ncand: [(1, 1, None, 6, 12), (401, 1, None, 6, 12), (805, 1, None, 6, 12), (1205, 2, None, 13, 22), (1605, 2, None, 3, 22), (2007, 3, None, 9, 28)]\nbase: [(1, 1, None, 6, 12), (403, 2, None, 20, 18), (805, 2, None, 20, 18), (1205, 2, None, 20, 16), (1605, 3, None, 26, 25), (2005, 3, None, 26, 25)]\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cd /home/agent/nhwork && python - <<'EOF'\nimport json\nd=json.load(open('c0.json'))\nprint('snapshot keys:', list(d['snapshots'][0]))\nb=json.load(open('seed0.json'))\ndef series(d):\n    out=[]\n    for s in d['snapshots']:\n        out.append((s.get('turn'), s.get('xp'), s.get('hunger'), s.get('energy'), s.get('hp')))\n    return out\nprint('cand:', series(d)[:6])\nprint('base:', series(b)[:6])\nEOF","time":{"start":179068