{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1790682123869,"sessionID":"ses_f132db44effejOC7YW0uFAg7SL","part":{"id":"prt_0ecf8ce54001VY94F1ymlCFbVb","messageID":"msg_0ecf8c81a001KJUTySsop1R8Pb","sessionID":"ses_f132db44effejOC7YW0uFAg7SL","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"reasoning","timestamp":1790682131314,"sessionID":"ses_f132db44effejOC7YW0uFAg7SL","part":{"id":"prt_0ecf8ce57001OrsGDEnD68wJTU","messageID":"msg_0ecf8c81a001KJUTySsop1R8Pb","sessionID":"ses_f132db44effejOC7YW0uFAg7SL","type":"reasoning","text":"While that runs (~25-30 min), let me think about the next design iteration and prepare it.\n\nLet me reconsider the mechanism. Key facts established:\n1. Score = max(depth, XP) milestone; XP drives it.\n2. Wizard has 6 energy at XP1, max energy 20 at XP2, 30 at XP3.\n3. Force bolt costs 5 energy, deals 1d6+1 (1 bolt at low level), never misses.\n4. Baseline: 190 kills / 13697 turns on seed 0 = 72 turns per kill.\n5. Casting re-rolls the trajectory; net effect so far ~0 with huge variance.\n\nWhat systematic lever could reliably raise XP?\n\n**Idea: XP comes from kills. Kills come from finding monsters.** The baseline spends a LOT of turns searching (1382 SEARCH actions on seed 0!) and issuing `# terrain` (169 times). If the wizard spends 1382 of 13697 turns searching, that's 10%.\n\n**Idea: the wizard has a wand of magic missile with 8 charges** — a free damage source that costs no energy. Zapping costs 1 turn and does 1d6+1 per missile × charges. 8 charges = 8 force-bolt-equivalents for free. That is strictly better than casting, energy-wise!\n\nThat's a compelling, focused idea: **use the wand of magic missile instead of (or in addition to) casting**. The bot already has a `zap` action in fight_heur (I saw `elif a[0] == 'zap':` in utils.action_str and the codebase has zapping for wands — `get_next_states(agent, wand, ...)` and `ranged_priority` uses `agent.inventory.get_best_ranged_set()`).\n\nWait — does `get_best_ranged_set()` already return the wand? It returns (launcher, ammo) for throwing. The mage's wand is handled by a separate 'zap' action. Let me look at how the zap action is generated in get_available_actions — I only saw 'melee', 'cast', 'ranged'. Let me grep for 'zap' in fight_heur.\n\nIf zapping is already implemented for wizards, then why doesn't the bot zap the magic missile wand? Maybe `wielding_ranged_weapon`/`get_best_ranged_set` picks the wand as \"ranged\" and the agent uses the 'ranged' action to *fire* it. Earlier the action histogram showed THROW 195 and no zap-ish thing. Hmm, but in NLE the action for firing a wand is the same 'ranged'/fire action. The baseline message log would show \"You fire 3 darts at the newt\" or \"The bolt hits\". Let me grep the candidate c0 messages for magic missile.\n\nLet me look at whether the bot fires the wand at all. If it does, then the wand is already used and zapping is a non-issue.\n\nLet me check the code for how ranged attacks are performed.","time":{"start":1790682123863,"end":1790682131290}}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1790682131568,"sessionID":"ses_f132db44effejOC7YW0uFAg7SL","part":{"id":"prt_0ecf8eb61001A9tdgtHaNQJS5d","messageID":"msg_0ecf8c81a001KJUTySsop1R8Pb","sessionID":"ses_f132db44effejOC7YW0uFAg7SL","type":"text","text":"While the 45-seed A/B runs, let me check whether the wand of magic missile is being used:","time":{"start":1790682131297,"end":1790682131557}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790682131797,"sessionID":"ses_f132db44effejOC7YW0uFAg7SL","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_function_5ndu0jucgjzk_1","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /workspace && rg -n \"zap|WAND|magic missile|get_best_ranged_set\" autoascend/combat/fight_heur.py autoascend/item/inventory.py | head -30"},"output":"autoascend/item/inventory.py:33:        'Wands': nh.WAND_CLASS,\nautoascend/item/inventory.py:771:    def get_best_ranged_set(self, items=None, *, throwing=True, allow_best_melee=False,\nautoascend/item/inventory.py:966:            f\"The {floor_regex} is riddled by bullet holes!\": ['magic missile'],\nautoascend/item/inventory.py:983:                return [O.from_name(w, nh.WAND_CLASS) for w in wand_types]\nautoascend/item/inventory.py:1005:            # return [O.from_name('opening', nh.WAND_CLASS),\nautoascend/item/inventory.py:1006:            #         O.from_name('probing', nh.WAND_CLASS),\nautoascend/item/inventory.py:1007:            #         O.from_name('undead turning', nh.WAND_CLASS),\nautoascend/item/inventory.py:1008:            #         O.from_name('nothing', nh.WAND_CLASS),\nautoascend/item/inventory.py:1009:            #         O.from_name('secret door detection', nh.WAND_CLASS),\nautoascend/combat/fight_heur.py:64:    launcher, ammo = agent.inventory.get_best_ranged_set()\nautoascend/combat/fight_heur.py:227:            ret.append((priority, ('zap', dy, dx, item, targeted_monsters)))\nautoascend/combat/fight_heur.py:320:    my_launcher, ammo = agent.inventory.get_best_ranged_set(additional_ammo=[i for i in projectiles_below_me])\n","metadata":{"output":"autoascend/item/inventory.py:33:        'Wands': nh.WAND_CLASS,\nautoascend/item/inventory.py:771:    def get_best_ranged_set(self, items=None, *, throwing=True, allow_best_melee=False,\nautoascend/item/inventory.py:966:            f\"The {floor_regex} is riddled by bullet holes!\": ['magic missile'],\nautoascend/item/inventory.py:983:                return [O.from_name(w, nh.WAND_CLASS) for w in wand_types]\nautoascend/item/inventory.py:1005:            # return [O.from_name('opening', nh.WAND_CLASS),\nautoascend/item/inventory.py:1006:            #         O.from_name('probing', nh.WAND_CLASS),\nautoascend/item/inventory.py:1007:            #         O.from_name('undead turning', nh.WAND_CLASS),\nautoascend/item/inventory.py:1008:            #         O.from_name('nothing', nh.WAND_CLASS),\nautoascend/item/inventory.py:1009:            #         O.from_name('secret door detection', nh.WAND_CLASS),\nautoascend/combat/fight_heur.py:64:    launcher, ammo = agent.inventory.get_best_ranged_set()\nautoascend/combat/fight_heur.py:227:            ret.append((priority, ('zap', dy, dx, item, targeted_monsters)))\nautoascend/combat/fight_heur.py:320:    my_launcher, ammo = agent.inventory.get_best_ranged_set(additional_ammo=[i for i in projectiles_below_me])\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cd /workspace && rg -n \"zap|WAND|magic missile|get_best_ranged_set\" autoascend/combat/fight_heur.py autoascend/item/inventory.py | head -30","time":{"start":1790682131530,"end":1790682131631}},"id":"prt_0ecf8eb67001dXLl3V8Aij45Dl","sessionID":"ses_f132db44effejOC7YW0uFAg7SL","messageID":"msg_0ecf8c81a001KJUTySsop1R8Pb"}}
