rns/kill); descending to dlvl 3-5 gives 15-25 XP/kill, and indeed the only seeds that reached Xp:9/Xp:10 did so while at depth 4-5. That changes the plan rather than the combat. Cost: 2 × 13 min. Ask whether to run it.\n\nAlso worth flagging: I found and verified a latent bug in the pre-existing code at global_logic.py:409 (`role == [Character.BARBARIAN, Character.WIZARD]` compares a str to a list, always False) — the kitten is never treated as a pet. But I reverted that too, and it's out of scope for this task; mentioning it is useful.\n\nLet me keep it tight but complete. The user asked \"Continue if you have next steps, or stop and ask for clarification if you are unsure how to proceed.\" I should present the result and ask.\n\nLet me double-check that file:409 detail is real and pre-existing.","time":{"start":1790686945433,"end":1790686951969}}}
